1. The borrower can possess multiple roles but also if a user Blocks a user and Revokes his role, Unblocking the same user should Grant the user their role back



2. Separate the logic for revoking roles and blocking deposits for borrowers. This will prevent the system from revoking credentials during the blocking process, ensuring that the account's role remains intact.

